  "intro": {
    "text": "Add `-dA` to a noun to say where: *-da* after a back vowel, *-de* after a front one. *öýde* (at home), *otagda* (in the room), *mekdepde* (at school). The *d* never changes.",
    "see": "gp-locative"
  },
