      "question": "How do you say **in the kitchen**?",
      "options": ["aşhanada", "aşhanade", "aşhanata", "aşhanda"],
      "optionsLang": "tk",
      "answer": 0,
      "why": {
        "1": "The last vowel of *aşhana* is *a*, a back vowel, so the ending is *-da*.",
        "2": "The *d* of this ending never changes: *-da*.",
        "3": "The ending goes onto the whole word: *aşhana* + *-da*."
      },
      "explain": "Back vowel *a*: *aşhana* + *-da* = *aşhanada*."
    },
    {
      "id": "a1-u05-l01-e03",
